    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "10599663b640cc066696": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "43be7944e68b0d8bdf7a": "Well met, $c.  You want some advice?  Befriend a mage!  We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do...",
        "4a1059eb44fd642b7aba": "I am interested in mage training.",
        "e1cbfa40f1a72eceb020": "I am interested in mage training.",
        "fb72abab4d7100c5121f": "Greetings.  I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage."
      },
      "name": "Juli Stormkettle",
      "subName": "Mage Trainer",
